{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIwL0NoaWxkaG9vZCUyMDIuMCUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Childhood 2 0","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/g9IyIdg3E7VH5CsRFLwLVePL9z0.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xF7AonVsGFPnNYPB3C9Oic3azI6.jpg","description":"For the first time in history, mental illness and suicide have become one of the greatest threats to school-aged children. Many parents still view dangers as primarily physical and external, but they’re missing the real danger: kids spending more time online and less time engaging in real life, free play, and autonomy. What are the effects on the next generation's mental, physical, and spiritual health? Childhood was more or less unchanged for millennia, but this is Childhood 2.0.","releaseInfo":"2020","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.1","runtime":"89 min","cast":["Skyler Sledge","Shauna Sledge","Avi Khanna","Isabella Smouse","Soloman Smouse Jr.","J. Lee Brown","Susanne Morrissey","Isabella Jody"],"director":["Robert Muratore","Jamin Winans"],"released":"2020-08-26T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"The Living Experiment","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Skyler Sledge","character":"Young Boy"},{"name":"Shauna Sledge","character":"Mom"},{"name":"Avi Khanna","character":"Tween Boy"},{"name":"Isabella Smouse","character":"Tween Girl"},{"name":"Soloman Smouse Jr.","character":"Teen Boy"},{"name":"J. Lee Brown","character":"Teen Girl"},{"name":"Susanne Morrissey","character":"Teen Girl"},{"name":"Isabella Jody","character":"Kids on Bikes"},{"name":"Connor Jody","character":"Kids on Bikes"},{"name":"Matthew Hamilton","character":"Kids on Bikes"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"ucrDBe8v1q4","type":"Trailer"}],"trailerStreams":[{"title":"Trailer","ytId":"ucrDBe8v1q4"}]}}